    - target: {fileID: 676244225140074482, guid: 2290421a90386fe40b7a4497c38b7323, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteContent
      value: "TO ANYONE WHO FINDS THIS,\r\n\r\nDo not explore this sector alone.
        The corridors are not secure, and something hostile is still moving through
        the facility. The upper levels were supposed to remain isolated, but the
        breaches have made that impossible to maintain.\r\nWithout a guard, you will
        not make it far. Stay near the secure zones, and do not enter any locked
        wing unless you are prepared for contact. Silence in Sector Null is never
        a sign of safety.\r\n\r\n\u2014 Security Notice\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3173352636163525320, guid: 2290421a90386fe40b7a4497c38b7323, type: 3}
